My dwm build
============

Keybinds
--------
<MOD> - Windows key

<MOD> + Return		- Spawn terminal
<MOD> + p		- Open dmenu
<MOD> + b		- Toggle bar
<MOD> + s		- Make window sticky
<MOD> + u		- Increment gaps
<MOD> + i		- Increment inner gaps
<MOD> + o		- Increment outer gaps
<MOD> + Shift + u	- Decrement gaps
<MOD> + Shift + i	- Decrement inner gaps
<MOD> + Shift + o	- Decrement outer gaps
<MOD> + y		- Toggle gaps
<MOD> + Shift + y	- Default gaps
<MOD> + j		- Next window
<MOD> + k		- Previous window
<MOD> + a		- Previously selected window
<MOD> + z		- Master window
<MOD> + Shift + j	- Swap selected & next window
<MOD> + Shift + k	- Swap selected & previous window
<MOD> + Shift + a	- Swap selected & previously selected window
<MOD> + Shift + z	- Swap selected & master window
<MOD> + <TAG>		- Go to <TAG>
<MOD> + Shift + <TAG>	- Move selected window to <TAG>
<MOD> + Ctrl + <TAG>	- ???
<MOD> + Ctrl + Shift + <TAG> - ?!??!
<MOD> + l		- Increase selected window size
<MOD> + h		- Decrease selected window size
<MOD> + w		- Kill window
<MOD> + Shift + Space	- Toggle window floating
<MOD> + t		- Tiling layout
<MOD> + f		- Floating layout
<MOD> + m		- Monocle layout
<MOD> + Shift + f	- Fibonnaci (spiral) layout
<MOD> + w		- Dwindle layout
<MOD> + Space		- Default layout (fibbonaci)
<MOD> + Shift + q	- Quit dwm
<MOD> + Shift + r	- Reload dwm

NOTE: The number keys for <TAG> are made for the Czech keyboard layout

Layouts
-------
* Tiling (default)

Patches
-------
* alpha (https://dwm.suckless.org/patches/alpha/)
* colorbar (https://dwm.suckless.org/patches/colorbar/)
* hide_vacant_tags (https://dwm.suckless.org/patches/hide_vacant_tags/)
* restartsig (https://dwm.suckless.org/patches/restartsig/)
* stacker (https://dwm.suckless.org/patches/stacker/)
* statuscmd (https://dwm.suckless.org/patches/statuscmd/) 
* sticky (https://dwm.suckless.org/patches/sticky/)
* vanitygaps (https://dwm.suckless.org/patches/vanitygaps/)

